# Website Mini Agent — client (dashboard) environment
# Copy to `.env` in this folder. Only variables prefixed VITE_ reach the browser bundle.

# Leave empty in local development — Vite proxies /api, /widget.js, /media and /mock-assets to
# http://localhost:4000 automatically (see vite.config.js). Set this to your deployed API's origin
# for production builds and for pointing local dev at a non-default port or a remote API.
VITE_API_URL=
